{'symbol': 'MLM', 'date': '2019-11-06 22:30:00', 'title': 'MARTIN MARIETTA MATERIALS, INC. DECLARES QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND, PAYABLE ON DECEMBER 31, 2019', 'text': 'MARTIN MARIETTA MATERIALS, INC. ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.55 PER SHARE ON THE COMPANY’S OUTSTANDING COMMON STOCK. THIS DIVIDEND, WHICH REPRESENTS A CASH DIVIDEND OF $2.20 PER SHARE ON AN ANNUALIZED BASIS, IS PAYABLE ON DECEMBER 31, 2019, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON DECEMBER 2, 2019.'}